%N A398369 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * H(k) * AH(k) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and AH(k) = A058313(k)/A058312(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number.
%H A398369 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.6.4, pp. 344-346, eq. (4.142).
